    {
      "id": "clearkey",
      "description": "One ClearKey entry at the root (4.1.1) and a track referencing it by refID (4.1.2). systemID is the one 4.3 requires for ClearKey, laURL is present as 4.3 recommends, and the optional pssh is omitted. The track's initRef names an entry for which its data is an ftyp followed by moov/trak/mdia/minf/stbl/stsd/encv carrying sinf with frma (avc1), schm (cbcs) and schi/tenc (version 1, pattern 1:9, default_KID 01234567-89ab-cdef-0123-456789abcdef, 16-byte constant IV) - the boxes CMSF-01 4.2 names.",
      "input": {
        "text": "{\"version\": \"1\", \"contentProtections\": [{\"refID\": \"ck\", \"defaultKID\": [\"01234567-89ab-cdef-0123-456789abcdef\"], \"scheme\": \"cbcs\", \"drmSystem\": {\"systemID\": \"1077efec-c0b2-4d02-ace3-3c1e52e2fb4b\", \"laURL\": {\"url\": \"https://clearkey.example.com/license\"}}}], \"tracks\": [{\"name\": \"video\", \"packaging\": \"cmaf\", \"isLive\": true, \"initRef\": \"init-video\", \"role\": \"video\", \"codec\": \"avc1.640028\", \"width\": 1920, \"height\": 1080, \"bitrate\": 5000000, \"framerate\": 30, \"contentProtectionRefIDs\": [\"ck\"]}], \"initDataList\": [{\"id\": \"init-video\", \"type\": \"inline\", \"data\": \"\"}]}"
